  "live_records": {
    "q-14467": {
      "dom_id": "step-q14467",
      "name": "Question 1",
      "problem": "$\\frac{9{v}^{2}+3v}{v+9}÷(3v+1)=$",
      "worked_solution": "To compute\n\n$$\n\\frac{9{v}^{2}+3v}{v+9}÷(3v+1),\n$$\n\nwe just need to multiply by the reciprocal of the divisor:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{9{v}^{2}+3v}{v+9}÷(3v+1) & = \\\\ \\frac{9{v}^{2}+3v}{v+9}\\cdot \\frac{1}{(3v+1)} & = \\\\ \\frac{3v(3v+1)}{v+9}\\cdot \\frac{1}{(3v+1)} & = \\\\ \\frac{3v\\cancel{(3v+1)}}{(v+9)}\\cdot \\frac{1}{\\cancel{(3v+1)}} & = \\\\ \\frac{3v}{v+9}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
