    "q-29966": {
      "dom_id": "step-q29966",
      "name": "Question 2",
      "problem": "If $\\frac{24{a}^{3}{b}^{2}}{25{c}^{3}}\\cdot X=\\frac{12a{b}^{3}}{15c},$ then what is $X?$",
      "worked_solution": "Since $\\frac{24{a}^{3}{b}^{2}}{25{c}^{3}}\\cdot X=\\frac{12a{b}^{3}}{15c},$ we have\n\n$$\nX=\\frac{12a{b}^{3}}{15c}÷\\frac{24{a}^{3}{b}^{2}}{25{c}^{3}}.\n$$\n\nTo compute this quotient, we just need to multiply by the reciprocal of the divisor:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{12a{b}^{3}}{15c}÷\\frac{24{a}^{3}{b}^{2}}{25{c}^{3}} & = \\\\ \\frac{12a{b}^{3}}{15c}\\cdot \\frac{25{c}^{3}}{24{a}^{3}{b}^{2}} & = \\\\ \\frac{12\\cdot a{b}^{2}\\cdot b}{3\\cdot 5c}\\cdot \\frac{5\\cdot 5c\\cdot {c}^{2}}{12\\cdot 2{a}^{2}\\cdot a{b}^{2}} & = \\\\ \\frac{\\cancel{12}\\cdot \\cancel{a{b}^{2}}\\cdot b}{3\\cdot \\cancel{5c}}\\cdot \\frac{5\\cdot \\cancel{5c}\\cdot {c}^{2}}{\\cancel{12}\\cdot 2{a}^{2}\\cdot \\cancel{a{b}^{2}}} & = \\\\ \\frac{b}{3}\\cdot \\frac{5{c}^{2}}{2{a}^{2}} & = \\\\ \\frac{5b{c}^{2}}{6{a}^{2}}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
